meta {
  name: OS Assignments
  seq: 8
}

docs {
  Declares which OS version a device or group *should* run. The
  orchestrator compares against its booted image and performs a
  `bootc switch` + reboot when they differ. `immediate: true` applies the
  update right away instead of waiting for a maintenance window.

  The device resolves its **first** active assignment, so delete obsolete
  assignments when rolling out a new one.
}
